WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.975
Who does what?

2
00:00:00.975 --> 00:00:03.555
Developers build the access automation;

3
00:00:03.555 --> 00:00:07.500
they read Python and JSON and
know dynamic membership rules.

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.402
Entitlement management
owners keep the packages,

5
00:00:10.402 --> 00:00:14.963
and only an Identity Governance
Administrator can create an automatic policy.

6
00:00:14.963 --> 00:00:18.901
Policy reviewers approve each file
before it reaches the tenant.

7
00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:21.688
The manager of record
approves requests and

8
00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.475
decides each item on a
mover's residual sheet.

9
00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:28.251
And the I S S O files the
evidence: the lint runs,

10
00:00:28.251 --> 00:00:31.990
the empty scan, the
sheets and the intervals.
